$meta
  title = Gotham City Builder
  description = Build and manage your own Gotham City. Zone the streets, lay down power and water, fight crime with GCPD and the Bat, and keep the money flowing.
  tags = gotham, simcity, city-builder, batman, tycoon, simulation
  header
    mode = minimal

kv = {import:kv-plugin}

// ------------------------------------------------------------------
// GOTHAM FLAVOR LISTS — read by the game engine (see src/game.js).
// Each list is a flat list of plain items; the engine reads them with
// root.<list>.selectOne.evaluateItem
// ------------------------------------------------------------------

districts
  The Narrows
  Old Gotham
  The Diamond District
  Tricorner
  Burnley
  Otisburg
  Park Row
  Robinson Park
  Amusement Mile
  The East End
  Gotham Heights
  Chinatown
  The Financial District
  The Cauldron
  Coventry
  Crime Alley
  Blackgate Isle
  West Point
  Midtown

headlines
  City Council Votes To {Raise|Keep|Lower} {Taxes|Dock Fees|Parking Fines}
  GCPD Unveils New {Bat|Crime|Anti-Riot} Task Force
  Wayne Enterprises Reports Record {Quarter|Earnings|Dividends}
  Iceberg Lounge: {Smash|Quiet} Opening Night
  Traffic On The {Burnley Bridge|Tricorner Freeway} {Improves|Worsens}
  {Heat Wave|Rainstorm|Fog Bank} Moves Into Gotham
  Blackgate Prison At {Over|Under} Capacity
  Mystery {Vigilante|Bat} Spotted On Rooftops Again
  Arkham Asylum Denies {Breakout|Curfew|Lights Out} Rumors
  Real Estate Values {Soar|Sink} In [districts.selectOne.evaluateItem]
  City Announces {New|Failed|Ambitious} Recycling Program
  Gotham University {Wins|Loses} The Ivy League Match
  Fountain Restored In Robinson Park After {Vandalism|Generous Donation}
  Vendors Report {Record|Disappointing} Sales At The {Night|Day} Market

mayorSpeech
  Another day in Gotham, Mayor. The city is yours to ruin or save.
  Gotham needs more than hope. It needs zoning permits.
  Somewhere in this city, a villain is buying real estate. Stay ahead of him.
  The GCPD sends their regards. They also send their budget requests.
  Nothing says "I've made it" like a functioning power grid in Gotham.
  Remember: every city has a dark side. Gotham's just comes with a grappling hook.
